   "text": "We have donors who've been giving every month for 9, 10, 11 years, not because we push them, but because they found something that felt real and they don't want to stop. People are waiting for something they can actually trust, a way to give that shows them the person, shares the outcome, and doesn't disappear into a logo and a distant promise.",
